id: pm-slack-standup-progress-evidence
title: Report progress gains with evidence revisions across standup windows
description: "Deliver a read-only typed SDK and compact CLI projection of passing test facts, explicitly accepted criterion evidence and declared readiness changes. Reuse SDK verified history and canonical item reads; preserve lifecycle activity as separate counts."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-28T23:07:24.361Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-28T23:48:35.517Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: A status-only edit never appears as verified progress; Each reported gain names its evidence revision; The same evidence is not counted twice across reporting windows
comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-28T23:07:32.517Z",codex-agent,"Overlap recheck: standup lifecycle sections and compare snapshots count statuses; core PmClient.listAllComplete, history verification/replay and native linked tests supply facts; pm-review reviewCoverage supplies reviewed/gap attention, explicitly not acceptance. pm-evidence supplies source freshness. None delivers periodic evidence gains deduplicated against verified item history. Implement a read-only projection with caller-held revision checkpoints, native passing tests, and strict explicit accepted/readiness declarations; never infer acceptance from reviewed or status. No tracker writes, imports, sync, journaled apply, shared checkpoints or background delivery are added."
  "2026-10-28T23:21:16.762Z",codex-agent,"Focused evidence and no-git CLI checks pass: status/comment-only windows have zero gains; original revision citations, deterministic retries, deduplicated older runs and normalized declaration replays are covered. Public validation at source head 5c10bafbca1b9d0399a562cf8d4ac503ab345d99: read-only non-git copy, git absent from PATH, 106 items, 1008 history events, 106 pages, 258 status activity events, 222 comment activity events, 235 foreign annotations, zero gains/refusals/replay gains; all 218 source files byte-unchanged. Zero recorded passing runs or explicit acceptance/readiness declarations is reported honestly, with no inference from green prose. Full npm/Bun gates will run in CI at unchanged coverage and duplication thresholds."
  "2026-10-28T23:27:24.900Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof in disposable copies: removing deduplication, omitting targetRevision from evidence identity, or citing the final window revision for every gain each failed the native-results regression (3/3 failed as required). The restored implementation passed the same selected regression 1/1. The first 500-sequence real-SDK model passed 1500 native state mutations with zero mismatches, including relationship/body preservation and whitespace/CRLF old-input replays. A final model pass adds random ambient focus and bounded fixture cleanup. Focused module checks passed 7/7 and measured 100 percent statements, branches, functions and lines; per-read-boundary peer appends are observed once across returned prefixes. No journaled apply or shared checkpoint mutation exists in this read-only feature."
  "2026-10-28T23:33:23.546Z",codex-agent,"Final targeted checks: native linked runner 1/1 commands and 7/7 tests passed, with automatic recording correctly left disabled by existing project policy. Current focused CLI/module/smoke checks passed 13/13; the module measured 100 percent in all four coverage dimensions. Public validation was repeated after switching checkpoint and evidence hashes to the SDK canonical history primitives, with identical 106-item/1008-event measurements, zero refusals and all 218 files unchanged. Typecheck, test typecheck, lint, zero duplication, docstrings and changelog generation/check passed. Full npm/Bun acceptance and packed npm/Bun global/local hosts remain the CI release-gate responsibility."
  "2026-10-28T23:35:10.444Z",codex-agent,"Final seeded model with random ambient focus passed 500/500 operation sequences and 1500 native state mutations, with zero SDK read-back mismatches. Per-sequence SDK cleanup keeps the shared non-git fixture bounded. All requested code, SDK/CLI, strict input/output validation, docs, public-data probe and interleaving/revert evidence are complete. No pm CLI/SDK defect was found; linked-result persistence remains intentionally disabled by existing policy. Release this claim for orchestrator verification; leave the item in progress. CI release gates at the final pushed head, including all six packed host scenarios, are the remaining external check and will be linked on the PR."
  "2026-10-28T23:42:35.227Z",codex-agent,"Final contract review tightened the seeded model to choose random clear-both, clear-comments, clear-runs or status-only operations before replay, with intermediate SDK read-back. Checkpoints now hash canonical SDK item identity so their bounded token length does not depend on legacy id length; operator ids defer to SDK normalization instead of applying the evidence display-label limit. PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-slack-standup/pull/164 remains ready for review; final-head CI will supersede the first queued run."
  "2026-10-28T23:48:32.363Z",codex-agent,"The strengthened random-operation model exposed a test-oracle projection distinction: SDK full reads represent some empty collections explicitly, while the native canonical write format omits them. Both reference and SDK-read-back states now pass through canonicalDocument before comparison, without hand-written normalization. The focused final feature tests pass 7/7 at 100 percent module coverage in all four dimensions; canonical SDK primitives also loaded successfully from the packed minimum host 2026.10.20. The strengthened 500-sequence model is running and CI will validate the final head. Automated review receipts contain skips, budget/trial limits or neutral results and are not approval."
